.el .ds Aq '
.TH dotman-import 1  "import "
.SH NAME
dotman\-import \- Convert another setup into the repo, or add what the repo lacks from one
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdotman import\fR [\fB\-\-overlay\fR] [\fB\-\-include\-missing\fR] [\fB\-\-render\-templates\fR] [\fB\-\-swap\fR] [\fB\-\-keep\-history\fR] [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-bootstrap\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-root\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISOURCE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert another setup into the repo, or add what the repo lacks from one
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-overlay\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
Add what SOURCE has and the repo lacks as one commit: modes, and with `\-\-include\-missing` files
.TP
\fB\-\-include\-missing\fR
With `\-\-overlay`, add the files the repo lacks without asking
.TP
\fB\-\-render\-templates\fR
For a chezmoi source, run its templates and import this host\*(Aqs rendering
.TP
\fB\-\-swap\fR
Replace the symlinks of an imported farm with real files holding the same bytes
.TP
\fB\-\-keep\-history\fR
For a git source whose history holds a credential or an age secret key in a file, a file\*(Aqs name or a commit, import every commit, and with them what the guard found, instead of one commit of the current tree
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Do not ask before writing
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-bootstrap\fR
Do not write install.sh, the script that sets up `dotman` in a container
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show the report and change nothing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fISOURCE\fR]
Legacy dotman repo, chezmoi source, symlink\-farm directory, yadm, bare or vcsh repo, or git URL to convert; found in $HOME when omitted
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show verbose output
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress informational messages
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR
Disable pager output
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-root\fR
Allow running as root
